================================================================================
Per-source attribution requirement
================================================================================

This server retrieves data from public biomedical databases at query time.
Users embedding `grounded-bio-mcp` in publications are expected to cite the
upstream sources of any data they rely on (NCBI, UniProt, RCSB PDB,
AlphaFold DB, EBI, ChEMBL, PubChem, Ensembl, Europe PMC, Reactome, STRING,
Kazusa, NCBI BLAST, CRISPOR), not (or not only) this server. Per-source
citation expectations are documented in each tool's docstring and in the
project README.
